<title>CANADA: Canada January bankruptcies rise over year.</title>
<headline>Canada January bankruptcies rise over year.</headline>
<dateline>OTTAWA 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bankruptcies in Canada rose to 7,865 in January from 7,320 a year earlier, the Department of Consumer and Corporate Affairs said on Friday.</p>
<p>The department said 1,073 businesses and 6,792 consumers went bankrupt in the month.</p>
<p>The total was also up from December's 7,615 bankruptcies.</p>
<p>((Reuters Ottawa Bureau, 613-235-6745))</p>
